---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<Layout
	path="/privacy"
	title="Privacy policy"
	description={`Privacy policy for ${SITE.name}. We keep no accounts, store no uploaded images, and explain exactly what data we process.`}
	canonical="/privacy"
>
	<section class="container-page py-12 sm:py-16">
		<div class="container-prose">
			<p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
			<h1 class="mt-3 text-display-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy policy</h1>
			<p class="mt-2 text-caption text-mute">Last updated: {updated}</p>

			<div class="prose mt-6">
				<p>
					{SITE.name} (the “Site”) respects your privacy. This policy explains what happens to the
					images and data you give us when you use the Site.
				</p>
				<h2>What we collect</h2>
				<p>
					We do not require an account and we do not store your uploaded images. When you use the font
					finder, your image is sent to our servers only long enough to be analyzed by the AI model,
					then discarded. It is never written to disk, logged, or retained.
				</p>
				<h2>Standard technical data</h2>
				<p>
					Like most websites we collect routine technical data — your IP address, browser type, device,
					and the pages you visit — to keep the service running, protect it from abuse (including rate
					limiting and bot detection), and understand aggregate usage.
				</p>
				<h2>Advertising</h2>
				<p>
					We may display advertisements served by third parties, such as Google AdSense. These providers
					may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits. You can opt
					out of personalized advertising via Google’s ad settings.
				</p>
				<h2>Analytics</h2>
				<p>
					If we enable Google Analytics, it collects aggregated usage data (pages visited, referral
					sources, approximate location) so we can improve the Site. You can install the official opt-out
					browser extension to prevent tracking.
				</p>
				<h2>Cookies</h2>
				<p>
					We use a small cookie to remember your light/dark theme preference. Advertisers and analytics
					providers may set their own cookies as described above. You can clear or block cookies in your
					browser settings at any time.
				</p>
				<h2>Children</h2>
				<p>The Site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>
				<h2>Your rights</h2>
				<p>
					Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, or delete personal data we
					hold about you. Since we store so little, the fastest way to exercise these rights is to{' '}
					<a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
				</p>
				<h2>Changes</h2>
				<p>
					We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be posted on this page.
				</p>
				<h2>Contact</h2>
				<p>
					Questions? Email{' '}
					<a href={`mailto:hello@${SITE.domain}`}>hello@{SITE.domain}</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>